  "description": "NHibernate provider for Rmp.GraphOrm, for legacy and modern .NET apps. ISession extension methods that load an object graph in one SQL query with no duplicated rows, enlisted in the session's transaction. Uses GraphOrm conventions/attributes next to your existing NHibernate mappings, which stay unchanged. Runs on .NET Framework 4.6.2+, .NET Standard 2.0 and .NET 8/10. Report issues at https://github.com/rubiconmp/public-issues",
